logarithm.  This elementary corollary of the explicit Mertens upper bound is
the exact prime-mass hypothesis used by the joint A.10 projection. -/
theorem eventually_primeReciprocals_le_realLog :
    ∀ᶠ Z : ℕ in atTop,
